sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant O as Order service
  participant P as Product service
  C->>O: request
  O->>O: 90% of the work done
  O->>P: call
  P-->>O: transient failure (5xx / timeout)
  Note over O: wait, then retry (no need to redo the 90%)
  O->>P: retry
  P-->>O: success
  O-->>C: response
